+import InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarVariableCartanCurvatureForm
+import InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarHalfLogLiftAnalyticPureGauge
+import InfoGeometry.Thermo.BipolarPoissonAlgebra
+import InfoGeometry.Thermo.BipolarTwoDimensionalSkewObstruction
+import InfoGeometry.Thermo.BipolarLinearCosymplecticStructure
+import InfoGeometry.Thermo.BipolarGENERICThreeCoordinateModel
+import Mathlib
+
+/-!
+# Variable connection, Poisson, and cosymplectic closure
+
+This capstone closes the nearest theorem frontier identified by the recovered
+operator blueprint.  It joins only already-proved statements:
+
+1. the point-dependent logarithmic Cartan connection has zero bundled
+   curvature;
+2. on a compatible logarithm chart its half-log lift is a genuine local
+   pure-gauge primitive;
+3. a supplied commuting pair of genuine derivations defines a Poisson bracket;
+4. the eta-Casimir condition kills every skew reversible map in two dimensions;
+5. adjoining the auxiliary coordinate yields the normalized linear
+   cosymplectic pair `(deta, dtheta wedge da)` and a nontrivial GENERIC system.
+
+No global gauge trivialization, smooth-bundle classification, or physical
+identification is added.
+-/
+
+noncomputable section
+
+namespace InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarVariableConnectionPoissonCosymplecticClosure
+
+open InfoGeometry.Analysis.BipolarCrossRatioLog
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarLogSL2
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarTwoSheetOperatorConnectionBridge
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarVariableCartanMaurerCartan
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarVariableConnectionAnalyticExterior
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarVariableCartanCurvatureForm
+open InfoGeometry.Canonical.BipolarHalfLogLiftAnalyticPureGauge
+open InfoGeometry.Thermo.BipolarPoissonAlgebra
